        StaticBook("Merry Firebrands", "Sentis", "Merry Making Firebrands \n\n\nBy: Sentis Vul'Tohorran\nIf ye stand, with shaking knees \n\nAnd many a drink in hand; \n\nYou'll end up like, the Oren fools, \n\nNaught but firebrands!\nSo raise your pint and drink it quick, \n\nFeel your senses spoil. \n\nSo you can feel the cloudy haze, \n\nOf Oren's foolish toil.\nAs if entranced, by foolish thought, \n\nFeel your senses dull. \n\nPint in hand and song on tongue, \n\nYour logic rendered null!", ""),
