        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "This large hammer's head is a huge diamond, with a long steel handle, the top of it wrapping around the gem. The gem would arc out chaotic lightning bolts as you snapped your fingers. This state would last moderately long thanks to the size of the gem.", ""),
