        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Wedding Invations §0\n§0Walter - Best Man§0\n§0Jace - Ceremony Priest§0\n§0Kate - Bride's maid§0\n§0Eve - Maid of Honor§0\n§0Cadey - ?§0\n§0Blake - ?§0\n§0Raik§0\n§0Merilon§0\n§0Aldon §0\n§0The Stauntons\n\nAbigail was here.", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Dear Franswaar, §0\n§0\n§0I'm taking Eve on a honeymoon. We'll be back before the baby is §0born...unless§0 it comes early.§0\n§0\n§0\n§0With deepest love,§0\n§0~Sarahbelle K.\n\n\n§0P.S. I left you some food in the stove, so you wouldnt starve.\n\nloser§0\n§0-Eve", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "6th of Sun's Smile, 1569.§0\n§0\n§0Name: Odo Alexander§0\n§0\n§0Age: 25§0\n§0\n§0Race: Human, Heartlander.§0\n§0\n§0Anger managment issues.§0\n§0\n§0§\n\nFormer soldier of multiple armies.§0\n§0\n§0Began to enjoy killing right before the Axis formed, whilst fighting for Courland and agains the Gold Corps.§0\n§0\n§0Enjoys causing uneeded harm and pain to enemies. Possibly sadistic behaviours?\n\nRacist towwards Khas due to large amounts of propaganda.", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "15th of Snow's maiden, 1569.§0\n§0\n§0Patient: Quavinir.§0\n§0\n§0Race: Elf?§0\n§0\n§0Age: 204.§0\n§0\n§0Mental illness?: Deppression.§0\n§0\n§0Started?: 100+ years ago.\n\nAge at start?: 70.§0\n§0\n§0Things surrounding the start of the illness: For the fourth time, somebody close to Quavinir commited suicide.   He is persecuted for his religion, something called Yeu Rthulu. He is constantly harrased and bullied.\n\nHis dearly beloved husband, first lover by name of Dwyn.  Current mate seems to not care of Quavinir.  Only purpose for living is love for his first mate.  Further attempts to find a different purpose have all worked only temporarily. Maintains 'friend'\n\nrelationship with Dwyn. Refers to it in a bitter tone. My personal experience with my own deppression upon learning of mother's death could help provide personal insight.  Today's session closed. §0\n§0\n§0Conclusion: He is my friend and I believe I may help him\n\nto a better extent then just being a psychiatrist, perhaps as his friend as well, and concerning my own personal struggle concerning my sadness and deppression due to mom's death... blasted aspects, they took mom away! If I had just... if I had been there\n\nmaybe I could have helped. Somehow.", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "8th of The First Seed 1569.§0\n§0\n§0Name: Garrol§0\n§0\n§0Race: Mali'ker §0\n§0\n§0Age: 143§0\n§0\n§0Says there is another person in his mind. Possible split personality disorder?\n\nStarted 10-20 years ago.§0\n§0\n§0Confirmed it is two seperate individuals in one body. Being a mental mage would help right about now... make note to self to find teacher.§0\n§0\n§0Cassandara wants to make Garrol's body his own.\n\nEDIT: Patient two.§0\n§0\n§0Name: Cassandara§0\n§0\n§0Race: Human§0\n§0\n§0Age: Unkown§0\n§0\n§0Original sex: Female§0\n§0\n§0Psychological implentations of a female in a male's body... unkown.\n\nGarroll seems to carry a hidden book, perhaps inform Cassandara?§0\n§0\n§0The two do seem to like the idea of having seperate bodies.§0\n§0\n§0Cassandara likes the idea of being a golem. I would have to act as Impera I believe, I will have to ask\n\nDuncan and perhaps his teacher bout how golems work and if the idea of putting one into the golem is possible.§0\n§0\n§0Parameters for the golem is shaped like a female human, 6'4, slim and smooth. Pale skin.§0\n§0\n§0Cassandara believes herself suffering\n\nDeppression, Anxiety, anger issues, and she derives pleasure from murder. AKA Sadistic to a dangerous level. Further treatment and information needed.§0\n§0\n§0Confirmed placing a soul into a golem body is possible, by asking Akkor ironically.§0\n\nI have gotten a friend to agree to this idea. He will have to learn the methods to, and once he has learned, he will give me the runes so I may", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Courland Stuff:§0\n§0\n§01. Implement taxes.§0\n§0\n§02. Economy! Shops etc.§0\n§0\n§03. Housing, build homes, find residents.§0\n§0\n§04. Military! Find soldiers.§0\n§0\n§05. Have citizens record professions in roster\n\n6. Destroy old Riga.§0\n§0\n§07. Find 100x100 plot of land. §0\n§0\n§08. Build fleet.§0\n§0\n§09. Employ more Stewards", ""),
