        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "-11th of Sun's Smile, 1568§0\n§0\n§0We stood under the maw of the Bone Fort, it appeared that raiders had come once we were assigned rooms. I was knocked out during the battle along with another warrior. I must be stronger.\n\n-21st of The Amber Cold, 1568§0\n§0\n§0I approached the Bone Fort with it's defenses raised on High alert. I gained access as usual entering to find that the Prince of Oren lies in the Fort. Surely they will be pursuing soon enough.\n\nSandk1ng was here, humanistic is a fucking nigger and no one can log this shit, ooga booga, go back to africa", ""),
