        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "===================Advanced Alchemy notebook§0\n§0\n§0\n§0\n§0\n§0\n§0\n§0\n§0\n\n-------------------Moderate potion of Accuity§0\n§0-------------------§0\n§0\n§0-Distilled water§0\n§0-Lariheri Finger§0\n§0-Hafling's Grass§0\n§0-Crouching Feather\n\n-------------------Moderate Mending§0\n§0-------------------§0\n§0-Distilled Water§0\n§0-Mandragora§0\n§0-Tippen's root§0\n§0-Frost vine§0\n§0-Crouching feather\n\n-------------------Moderate Healing§0\n§0--------------------Distilled water§0\n§0-Serpent's stalk§0\n§0-Tippen's root§0\n§0-Blissfoil\n\n-------------------§0\n§0Greater Acuity Potion§0\n§0--------------------Aqua Vitae§0\n§0-Larihei's Fingers§0\n§0-Hafling's Grass§0\n§0-Crou hing Feather§0\n§0-Elf's Hair Vine\n\n-------------------Alchemist's Fire§0\n§0-------------------§0\n§0-Aqua Vitae§0\n§0-Serpent's Stalk§0\n§0-Athin", ""),
