        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "My Time as Cheiftess has been very smooth up till now, I have renovated the old College and Barracks below it, as well as constructed a wall around Sera, the name I have given the town. We plan to use this town as the center of knowledge so that mages and\n\nEnchanters can gather here. My first concern should be populating Sera with capable Enchanters and Blacksmiths.§0\n§0\n§0I have managed to find an Enchanter, an old 'friend' really. I hope I can start supplying him once I get the lapiz I ordered from Titus.\n\nThomas has been building something big, ive depleated my once thought endless stock of cobble and it still isnt enough. I wonder what this project could be.", ""),
