        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Official Document§0\n§0-------------------     Hochrot Lanze§0\n§0    ranking system§0\n§0\n§0Initiate: The rank of each member for their first saints week of joining the Lanze, this time will be used to see if they are a good fit.\n\nLanze: Rank of accepted Initiates, the first rank within the guard.§0\n§0\n§0Kracht: The Rank given to distinguished Lanze and leaders of Units.  a title of Honor.§0\n§0\n§0Halister: The second in command of a Unit. Rank given by Kracht.\n\nHelenor: Military leader and disciplinarian.§0\n§0\n§0Starke: The Highest rank a soldier can obtain, one of the highest honors a soldier of the Lanze can achieve, their word is second to the Chieftess.", ""),
