        StaticBook("Curse of Chairs", "§bHeruza", "Long ago, our ancestors, the four descendants of the first Man and Woman who were before anyone to walk Aegis, created the Chair. Chairs, as you obviously already know, are furniture which you sit in. However, they have a more nefarious purpose. All\n\nchairs are cursed. When one attempts to sit in a chair, they may be transported to another dimension. Chairs can be wooden or stone, and still have this strange effect. Even a king's throne can somehow malfunction and do this. It is unknown why this curse\n\nwas placed or how it is possible. It is also unknown how some people make it out of this dimension, but some speculate it is the work of the skygods or aengudaemons.", ""),
