        StaticBook("Magic License", "§bAuberon de Clare", "As by the Codex Arcana, and the Magic License Clause, this document licenses Leric Tresery to the practice of Clerical Magic (Xan).\n\n[!] The scroll bears a scribbled signature, along with a seal, in shape of\n\na Lorraine Cross, stamped into burgundy coloured wax. [!]\n\n-Knight Inquisitor Auberon de Clare\n\n\n#0031", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Dey azh§0\n§0Da patient Petyr Redlock had muuch tu zuffer, hi neeyds zum rezt aftur hi got hiz leg wunded weeyth ah battluax. Hi iz un da bed, restn' ahd dreeynkin' zum muzhrum tee mayd beey mi azziztand, Snawt. Mi wheeyl ztard da egzperiment nuw ahd whey wil\n\npeep whuut iz goyeen' tu happn'. Wi ahr in da zewerz, greeybing our ztuff tu ztart da egzperiment, azh ztuff wi neeyd iz ah poizounuzz rat, mi hab gakh radz, da radz wheeyl byte da padiend ghezt ahd mi wheeyl peep wub iz happen'. Da padiend zeemz tu bi\n\nangreh, treeyeng tu ezgayb, but mi buddeh heeyr stoppehd heem tu nub ezgayp! Ognak, da uruk, zmazhed da lit' squealz zkull un da wahll, mayking heem uncozgiouz. Zu, da padiend numba' azh fayled tu cuuperayt ahd hi guht flat, da badiend numba' dub mi\n\ntheeynk wheeyl bi muur hozh.§0\n§0\n§0Patiend numba' dub:", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "§0\n§0\n§0\n§0Gnarl'Lak: §0\n§0Hunting Journal§0\n§0\n§0*The old book, with a torn cover would rest before you. As you turn the pages you see it is written in blah*", ""),
        StaticBook("T.H.H Edition 1", "§bThamas Bucketfoot", "The Humble Hollow\n \nEdition 1\n\n15th of \nThe Grand Harvest\n\nEditors Note\n\nThis be the first edition of 'The Humble Hollow Newspaper' and will contain loads reading and prizes.\n\nIntroduction\n\nThis paper will be released every Elven Week on this date, it will contain the Weeks happenings and just great reads, with the occasional prizes!\n\nI will be handing these out for free, but donations of items would be great too!\n\nWeekly News\n\nNot much has happened this Elven Week but a few great, little things have happened!\n\nBaby Drogo was born! His proud parents Larry and Noara Neyas are thrilled to have him!\n\nI myself have become Jnr Deputy in the Sheriffs Department, so expect to see me around more often!\n\nThere have been rumours going around about a possible town move which could be exciting or a horrible mistake.\n\n___________________  Wanted List By Larry\n-------------------\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\nWell this be the end of this short newspaper, in the future they will be a lot longer for you to all read!\n\nKind Regards\n\nThamas Bucketfoot\n\nEditor: Thamas\nWanted list: Larry", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Arms: Chain mail (ringed together)§0\n§0\n§0Body: Olive green with brass buttons to hold it together (V-neck)§0\n§0\n§0Leggins: Chainmail ringed/§0\n§0\n§0Boots: Tanned Leather with dyed desert brown rope as laces.§0\n\nHands: Brain Tanned leather gloves (archer gloves)§0\n§0\n§0((If I missed anything tell me))§0\n§0\n§0Shoulders:§0\n§0leather pads", ""),
