        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "-The Nightmare-§0\n§0\n§0A year ago, a strange and unkown individual had a nightmare of horrific proportions. §0\n§0\n§0In his troubling nightmare, visions of insanity wrecked havoc upon his mind. Once he awoke, the boy had gone blind.\n\nThis blindness was truely an affliction from the nether, the boy had lost all memory of who he was. His eyes darkened to a near black colour with his pupils becoming a nearly blood red colour.\n\nSome thought he had been possesed by a shade. Others thought he had been taken by Iblees. Regardless, he was executed. A day later his corpse had been dug up, his eyes had been removed. A firm and carefully written letter was placed on the grave.", ""),
