        StaticBook("Hymms of canon", "§bCarleton Cassius", "Prayers Book\n\nSanctus\n\nSanctus,sanctus,sanctus Dominus deus sabaoth   \nPleni sunt caeli et terra gloria tua\n\nhosanna in excelsis\n\nBenedictus,qui venit in nomine domini.\n\nhosanna in excelsis.\n\nAmen.\n\nLux invicta\n\nLuceat eis lux invicta,luceat eis\n\ncum tui gratia sancte domine\n\nlux vestra\n\nac ostende eis via tua\n\nsanctum sanctorum viam\n\nAmen.\n\nPaster\n\nBenedictum sit nomen tuum.\n\nr.amen.\n\nBenedictum sit nomen tuum \n\nR.Amen\n\net dabis,Nobis messiarum\n\nHoren,owyn,godfrey,seigmund.\nR.benedicatur nomen eorum.\nvenerunt omnes in nomine tuo,\n\nR.Amen,Amen,Amen\n\net expanderunt verbum tuum et pro illo rogamus,ut pro nobis orent.\n\nR.ita faciemus\n\nAtque ponant omnes beatos et angelos nostre pietatis tesimonium.\n\nR.Nos permanebunt pios modis \n\nAmen.\n\nR.Amen\n\nAttende domine,et miserere,quia peccavimus tibi.\n2x\n\nad te rex summe oculos nostros sublevamus flentes exaudi et exaltabitur\n\nsupplicantum preces.\n\nattende domine,Et misere,quia\n\npeccavium tibi\n\ndextera patris\n\nlapis angularis\n\nvia salutis \n\nianua caelestis\n\nablue nostri\n\nmaculas delicti\n\nAttende domine,et misere,quia peccavimus tibi\n\nRogamus,Deus\n\nTuam majestatem\n\nauribus sacris\n\ngemitus exaudi\n\ncriminia nostra\n\nplacidus induldge,\n\nAttende domine,et miserere,quia peccavimus tibi \n\nTibi fatemur\n\nCrimina admissa\n\ncontrito Corde\n\npandimus occulta\n\ntua redemptor\n\npeitas ignoscat\n\nattende domine,et miserere quia peccavimus tibi\n2X\n\nDa pacem domine\n\nda pacem Domine in diebus nostris\n\nquia non est allus \n\nqui pugnet pro nobis\n\nnisi tu deus noster\n\nFiat pax in virtute tua:et abundantia in turribus tuis\n\nDa pacem domine in diebus nostris\n\nquia non est allius \n\nquis pugnet pro nobis\n\nnisi tu deus noster\n\n\nFiat pax in virtute tua: et abundantia in turribus tuis.\n \nDa pacem, Domine, in diebus nostris\nQuia non est alius\nQui pugnet pro nobis\nNisi tu Deus noster.\n\nPropter fratres meos et proximos meos loquebar pacem de te:\n \nDa pacem, Domine, in diebus nostris\nQuia non est alius\nQui pugnet pro nobis\nNisi tu Deus noster.\n\nPropter domum Domini Dei nostri quaesivi bona tibi.\n \nDa pacem, Domine, in diebus nostris\nQuia non est alius\nQui pugnet pro nobis\nNisi tu Deus noster.\n\nRogate quae ad pacem sunt Palatinus:et abundantia diligentibus te.\n \nDa pacem, Domine, in diebus nostris\nQuia non est alius\nQui pugnet pro nobis\nNisi tu Deus noster.\n\n Gloria Deus, sicut erat in principio et nunc et semper, et in saecula saeculorum. Amen\n\nDominus regnavit,\ndecorem indutus est:\nIndutus est Dominus fortitudinem,\net praecinxit se.\nEtenim firmavit orbem terrae,\nqui non commovebitur.\nParata sedes tua ex tunc;\nA saeculo tu es.\nElevaverunt flumina, Domine,\n\nElevaverunt flumina vocem suam,\nElevaverunt flumina fluctus suos,\nA vocibus aquarum multarum.\n\nMirabiles elationes maris;\nMirabilis in altis Dominus.\nTestimonia tua\ncredibilia facta sunt nimis;\nDomum tuam decet sanctitudo,\nDomine, in longitudinem dierum.\n\nloria Deus,\net Spiritui Sancto.\nSicut erat in principio,\net nunc, et semper,\net in saecula saeculorum, Amen.\n\nHosanna Filio Horen,\nBenedictus qui venit\nIn nomine Domini\nRex Oren\nHosanna in excelsis.\n\nAll hyms of the canon", ""),
        StaticBook("\"Clog\" Azh Novel", "§bDur'Zuub'Yar", "I was only 9 years old\nI loved clog so much, I had all of his merchandise.\nI pray to Clog every night before bed, thanking him for the food i have been given\nClog is love, i say, Clog is life\nMy popo hears me and calls me an edgy\nI knew he was just\n\njealous of my devotion to Clog\nI called him an Orenian Scum\nHe pvp defaulted me and sent me to the ban report section\nI'm crying and my fingers hurt from typing so hard\nI look at my computer and my eyes hurt\n\nA warmth is moving towards me\nI feel somethign touch me\nIt's Clog\nI am so happy\nHe whispers in my ear \"Diz am mi soop kitzhen\"\nHe grabs me with his bitty gobo hands and puts me on my hands and knees\n\nMy body is ready\nI take this rp to skype for shrek\nHe cyber penetrates my bumhole\nIt hurts so much but i do it for Clog\nI can feel my earbuds tearing and my eyes start to water\nI want to please Clog and the spirits\n\nHe roars his mighty gobo roar as he fills my earbuds with cyber\nMy popo walks in\nClog looks him straight in the eye and says \"Idz awl gobo now\"\nClog leaves through my window\nClog is love, Clog is life.", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "The Golem and The Cat§0\n§0\n§0It was in Sutica, 4th of the Amber Cold, 1546. There was a shiny black Golem with glowing blue eyes. He sat there, no expression on his face, but still staring at the cat that sat upon the smooth stone slabs.", ""),
