        StaticBook("Questioning 1", "§bJorah", "First questioning of Elven Women§0\n§0\n§0*Hears whispers, strangly enough for a moment I though I heard them as well, shook it off.§0\n§0\n§0*Claims the voice is of her torturer.§0\n§0 §0\n§0*Name is Pyria\n\n[The book is charred here]§0\n§0\n§0*Pyria broke down, looking at the wall behind me as if she saw something, then raising her hands to fire an arc of RED lightning.§0\n§0\n§0*Not much of a magical man, but I've never heard of lightning that was the color red.\n\n*Pyria turned her hands to us after blasting the wall, claiming we were \"puppets of Aerk'iath\". Barely got out of the way.§0\n§0\n§0*Pyria unconcious, will have to research Aerk'iath.§0\n\n*Cant find bugger all on \"Aerk'iath\".  Most likely some sort of deity?  Possibly the name of a cult?§0\n§0\n§0Need to question further for more information on identity of torturer, who Pyria is, and who or what \"Aerk'iath\" is.", ""),
