        StaticBook("Kralech <3 Nyann", "§bAxel Burchoff", "To: Lord Gregor\nSincerely: Axel Burchoff\n-------------------\n   May GOD guard you and your wonderful bride in piece, and hope. GOD is by your side, and so am I. I bless you with wonderful power. And you must know that all though I am not fight for you, I\n\nwill always be bound to Darkwood. I salute you and Lady Heather, GOD will take away all your fears. Congratultaions, my friend. Lord Gregor", ""),
        StaticBook("Symbol Regent's", "§bDaina Grandaxe", "*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*§0\n§0      Alchemy Regents§0\n§0*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*§0\n§0\n§0\n§0In this book will be listed all of the alchemy symbols that go into different classes wich are used for Alchemy Brewing.\n\n       Water Symbols§0\n§0*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*§0\n§0\n§0       Mandragora§0\n§0\n§0     Serpents Stalk§0\n§0\n§0         Frost Vine§0\n§0\n§0          Blissfoil§0\n§0\n§0           Athin\n\n         Fire Symbols§0\n§0*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*§0\n§0\n§0         Crimson Vase§0\n§0\n§0         Drakes Tail§0\n§0\n§0       Dwarfs Pumpkin§0\n§0\n§0        Blood Lotus§0\n§0\n§0   Flametounge Root\n\n         Air Symbols§0\n§0*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*§0\n§0\n§0     Lariheis Fingers§0\n§0\n§0       Elfs Hair Vine§0\n§0\n§0  Crouching Feather§0\n§0\n§0     Halflings Grass\n\n       Earth Symbols§0\n§0*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*§0\n§0\n§0       Tippens Roots§0\n§0\n§0     Alabaster Leaf§0\n§0\n§0           Saffvil§0\n§0\n§0       Clutchers Straw§0\n§0\n§0       Metzlis Tangle§0\n§0\n§0        Goblins Ivy", ""),
