        StaticBook("Books for Niera", "§bNiera Acal'elor", "Electromancy vers 4§0\n§0hydromancy vers 3§0\n§0fire evo vers 2§0\n§0Air evocation vers 2§0\n§0History of Magic§0\n§0The void§0\n§0The m&H vol 1-3§0\n§0On mali'aheral§0\n§0Ancient history vol 1-4§0\n§0Fall oF aegis§0\n§0hIstory of Malinor§0\n§0The Mali'ker§0\n\nTelekenesis\nElemental evocation", ""),
