        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "I have meet this man by the name of Xaiver. It turns out that he is super cute and nice. He is letting me stay with him at the time being. He has also made me a craft bench for me tinkering stuff. Moments like this is when I miss mother the most. She\n\nalways tell me to find a good elf to marry... maybe this will be the one who knows. I went to my first very fancy wedding today also. Xavier took me there cause he knew the Princess. Then this human said that i might cause damage... and then yeah that was\n\nabout it for the day now it is down time and i decied to start this jornal of my time here. §0\n§0\n§0-day one", ""),
        StaticBook("Basics of Runes", "§bBalorien \"Ien\" Navicula", "~Runesmithing~\n\nRunesmithing is a strange profession.\nFirst of all you need\nto obtaina runesmitihng table. After that you might notice that you have to make smybols using lapis, gold, or emerald.\n\nUnbreaking:\n\nUnbreaking enchantment is one of the easiest encant.\nto make it use 5 piece of lapis lazulit.\nPlace the lapis in this form\n \n        * *\n         *\n        * *\nYou have to form a X.\n\nSmite:\n\nThis enchantment is good againts unholy beasts. The symbol is the following.\n\n  **\n ****\n  **\n\nEfficieny:\n\nIt's a true help if you wish to mine faster or cut wood hastier.\nThe symbol is the following:\n\n  *\n   **\n  *\n\nLure:\n\nLure enchantment will help you cathc fish faster.\nThe Symbol is the following:\n\n *\n *\n * *\n\nLuck of the Sea\n\nThis enchantment helps to find treasure while fishing.\nThe symbol is the following.\n\n  ** *\n *  *\n  ** *\n\nAqua Affinity:\n\nThis enchantment helps you break blocks hastier under water.\n\n*\n**\n***\n **\n\nSilk Touch:\n\nThis enchantment helps you retrieving blocks witohut breaking them.\n\n*********\n\nFortune:\n\nIt' helps you to retrieve more valaubles while mining.\n\n**\n  *   *\n * * ***\n*  *  *\n\nLooting:\n\nIt' helps you gain more items form killing mobs.\n\n *      *\n***** ***\n *      *\n\nRespiration:\n\nHelps you breath underwater.\n\n****\n****\n ** \n*  *\n\nPunch:\n\nPunch works on bows and ot knock backs the enemies.\n\n ***\n****\n****\n ***\n\nKnockback\n\nIt works in meele weapons and knocks your enemies.\n\n**\n*****\n*****\n**\n\nBlast Protection:\n\nProtects you from explosions.\n\n      **\n ****\n******\n ****\n\nInfinity:\n\nIt allows you to shoot with a bow witohut losing arrows.\n\n *** ***\n*   *    *\n*   *    *\n *** ***\n\nProjectile Protection\n\nDefends you from arrows.\n\n*  *   ***\n **** ***\n*  *   ***\n         *\n\nSharpness:\n\nIt make your meele weapons to do more damage.\n\n  *\n********\n*********\n  *\n\nPower:\n\nIt make syour bow to do more damage.\n\n**     *\n  ******\n  *******\n**     *\n\nThorns:\n\nYou place it on your armor and if somebody hit you he will also be damaged.\n\n* * * * *\n* * * * *\n* * * * *\n* * * * *", ""),
